[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4582966704","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119897#issuecomment-4582966704","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119897","id":4582966704,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABESqFsA","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-30T13:32:19Z","updated_at":"2026-05-30T13:32:19Z","body":"I looked into this.\nThe root cause is on the data side, not the rendering itself: the Asset Store API returns `[ul]` list items separated by a **blank line** (`\\n\\n`), and the BBCode parser treats each blank line as an **empty list element**, giving it its own bullet.\nSo every item ends up showing `•` twice (one bullet for the empty separator line, one for the actual item).\n\nExample of the `body_bbcode` returned by `store.godotengine.org/api/v1` (Script-IDE):\n\n```\n[ul]\n\nScripts are now shown as Multiline Tabs\n\nScript Tab can be split\n\n...\n[/ul]\n```\n\n`RichTextLabel`'s `[ul]` (LIST_DOTS) assigns a bullet to **every line** inside the list, including the empty lines created by the `\\n\\n` separators.\n\n#### Minimal reproduction\n\n```gdscript\nextends Control\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n      var rtl := RichTextLabel.new()\n      rtl.bbcode_enabled = true\n      rtl.set_anchors_preset(Control.PRESET_FULL_RECT)\n      add_child(rtl)\n      # Blank-line separated -> each item shows the bullet twice (BUG):\n      rtl.append_text(\"[ul]\\n\\nItem one\\n\\nItem two\\n\\nItem three\\n[/ul]\")\n      # Single-newline separated -> renders correctly:\n      # rtl.append_text(\"[ul]\\nItem one\\nItem two\\nItem three\\n[/ul]\")\n```\n\n<img width=\"730\" height=\"340\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/006dad2d-d801-4f3b-a9f5-d382550fb4cb\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4582966704/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4583333905","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119897#issuecomment-4583333905","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119897","id":4583333905,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABETAgEQ","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-30T15:51:49Z","updated_at":"2026-05-30T15:51:49Z","body":"Duplicate of https://github.com/godotengine/godot-asset-store-tracker/issues/147","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4583333905/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]